[behaviors]
; What each person does when nobody is talking to them (anyone not listed stands still):
;   id stay                   never leaves their tile
;   id wander <radius>        roams within <radius> tiles (1-10) of where they start
; then optionally  pause <min> <max>  (seconds between moves, default 3 8)
; and, last,       emotes <name> ...  (wave, dance, cheer: played now and then while resting).
; An id is `guide` or one from [npcs]. Wanderers keep off waymarks, plants, creatures,
; doorways, exits, the player, and each other. Whoever the player talks to stops, turns to
; face the player, and waves goodbye when the conversation ends.
